{"Title":"An Act designating a portion of state highway Route 7 in the town of Sheffield as the Brigadier-General John G. Barnard highway\r\n","BillNumber":"H4617","DocketNumber":"HD5003","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"WSP1","Name":"Smitty Pignatelli","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WSP1","ResponseDate":"2024-03-21T16:34:24.99"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"WSP1","Name":"Smitty Pignatelli","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WSP1","ResponseDate":"2024-03-21T16:34:24.99"},{"Id":"PWM0","Name":"Paul W. Mark","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PWM0","ResponseDate":"2024-03-26T13:34:20.9766667"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"PWM0","Name":"Paul W. Mark","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PWM0","ResponseDate":"2024-03-26T13:34:20.977"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4617/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Pignatelli of Lenox and Senator Mark, a joint petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Smitty Pignatelli and Paul W. Mark that a certain portion of state highway Route 7 in the town of Sheffield be designated as the Brigadier-General John G. Barnard highway.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tThe portion of state highway route 7 in the town of Sheffield from the Sheffield American Legion Hall to the Barnard Park of Honor shall be designated and known as the Brigadier-General John G. Barnard Highway, in honor of Brigadier-General John G. Barnard, for his dedicated service in the United States Army as Chief Engineer of the Civil War Defenses of Washington. The Massachusetts Department of Transportation is hereby directed to erect suitable markers along said highway bearing said designation in accordance with the standards of the department.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in the OD with Recommended Amendment","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S29","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S29"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"H4617","Branch":"Senate","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4617/Branches/Senate/Amendments/1/"},{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"H4617","Branch":"House","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4617/Branches/House/Amendments/1/"}]}